>
>Quick fix is to change the sign on line 61 of the code chunk :
>
>  Rquantile = {
>         R <- object$A + object$M/2
>         E <- normalizeQuantiles(R, ...) - R
>         object$M <- object$M - E                     # wrong sign
>         object$A <- object$A + E/2
>     }
>
>to
>
>   Rquantile = {
>         R <- object$A + object$M/2
>         E <- normalizeQuantiles(R, ...) - R
