From rfinney5 at yahoo.com  Thu Dec 16 04:00:24 2004
From: rfinney5 at yahoo.com (Richard Finney)
Date: Thu Dec 16 04:00:38 2004
Subject: [BioC] Affymetrix file parsers released under LGPL open source
